# FastAPI

- Use an application factory/lifespan for resources; keep routers thin and domain code independent of request objects.
- Validate schemas, preserve OpenAPI compatibility, centralize safe errors, and apply approved Restrict authorization.
- Test routes, dependencies, lifespan, allow/deny/failure, validation, cancellation, and downstream timeouts.
